*.swp
*.bat
*.json
!data/**/*.json
!js/solver/tests/**/*.json
!js/solver/benchmarks/family_suite.json
!research/build-database/family-seed-browser-validation.json
# The browser tests need playwright-core, and `node_modules/playwright-core`
# is committed without its 12MB `lib/` (swallowed by the `lib/` rule below).
# Without a manifest a clean checkout cannot install it either, so the
# browser guard would skip silently forever.
!/package.json
data/temp/
sets/

.idea/
*.iml
.editor_log.txt

bin/
lib/
pyvenv.cfg
!rust/**/src/bin/

__pycache__

# binaryen ships a 104MB wasm-opt toolchain; build-wasm.sh finds it in
# node_modules but it is a build tool, not a checked-in artifact like
# playwright-core. `npm i` restores it from package.json.
node_modules/binaryen/
node_modules/.bin/wasm-*
node_modules/.bin/wasm2js
